{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"4320ec7defaf098f2714c364efbb5520e79d5420edd2e406c58696f96e32112d","digest":{"component_or_area":"op-cert trusted-environment key config and verification","key_entities":[".rebar/trusted_environments.yaml","src/rebar/attest/trusted_env.py","verify.require_environment","verify.opcert_enforce_since","env_id","public_key","added_at_commit","revoked_at_commit"],"problem_keywords":["trusted environment","public key pinning","certificate verification","out-of-band configuration","keyid spoofing defense","required environment policy"],"propositions":["A config loader must read and validate trusted-environment public keys from .rebar/trusted_environments.yaml with schema defining env_id, public_key, added_at_commit, and revoked_at_commit fields; absent file defaults to no required environment.","A certificate from an environment not in the pinned trusted set must fail the required-environment check.","A certificate whose signature does not verify against the pinned key for its required env_id must fail verification.","The required-environment check must verify against the pinned key, not the certificate's self-claimed keyid, to prevent keyid spoofing attacks.","The configuration is sourced from the review-gated main code branch, never the auto-pushed tickets branch."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785819446524352716,"uuid":"3831b6d3-b433-4246-99b5-77c124c5ddf1"}